          "id": "e9037ad5-d3e4-40b5-b097-818fc7a8570a",
          "memory": "Alex's basil plant was alive and thriving with six leaves as of October 7, 2026, up from four leaves in late September. User joked the pesto timeline moved up to 8 years and called the plant the 4-leaf oracle.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "94b28428-0b1c-4cca-84c0-a062b2956d64",
          "memory": "On October 7, 2026, when the Mega Millions jackpot was around $800 million, Alex skipped the office pool where a coworker bought about 20 tickets and bought his own lucky ticket, joking his basil picked the numbers after he held the ticket up to the leaves for good luck.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "67e97d3e-dce3-42b9-b79b-8f4084ed70a9",
          "memory": "Alex said on October 7, 2026 that if he won the ~$800 million Mega Millions jackpot he would rent out Mario's restaurant every Saturday to give free pizza to anyone who walks in, with unlimited garlic knots as non-negotiable, preferring to be the Saturday pizza guy over buying a yacht or mansion.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "28713746-5f92-413a-8bef-d75d4c5ab5c8",
          "memory": "On October 7, 2026, Alex heated up leftovers for dinner described as sad microwave rice and chicken, adding hot sauce to make it less sad while daydreaming about winning the lottery.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "77c05d8e-e45a-479e-8214-e93b4c303253",
          "memory": "On October 7, 2026, User was too tired to cook and ordered tacos from the taco truck near User's place known for a long line but worth it, noting it gives a mountain of onions; Alex said he wants to come try it sometime.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f3911c50-6b2e-422a-88f5-e0fd477586e4",
          "memory": "On October 7, 2026, User had a long workday with back-to-back meetings until about 5:30 p.m., while Alex said his afternoon was just boring emails.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f8e8bdc1-5318-44cf-9d6c-7035aa33cfdc",
          "memory": "As of October 7, 2026, User still has a single mystery sock from the sock saga living on User's dresser, with Alex joking User should adopt it as a dust rag at this point.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "45174041-cb12-402a-af67-c47fd697d94a",
          "memory": "On October 7, 2026, Alex's mom asked if his basil was big enough for cooking yet; when Alex said he had six leaves, she joked that is a garnish for one noodle, with User agreeing she is not wrong.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
